  "releaseNotes": "PeerSharp 5.0.0 is a major release. Breaking: Settings sub-objects are get-only; mutate their properties instead of replacing them. ConnectionSettings.PreferUtpRatioPercent and UtpWarmupSeconds were removed. Custom IAlerts implementations must provide DroppedAlertCount. Adds torrent identity and magnet helpers, transfer and lifetime statistics, proxy capability reporting, and configurable transfer and alert policies. Fixes uTP SACK emission, congestion and timeout recovery, transport fallback, request limits, and web-seed retries. See https://github.com/ligenq/PeerSharp/blob/v5.0.0/CHANGELOG.md for migration notes.",
